Data
----
- Cartridge and chamber dimensions and pressures: C.I.P. (Commission Internationale Permanente pour l'Epreuve
  des Armes a Feu Portatives), Tables of dimensions of cartridges and chambers (TDCC), public part,
  https://bobp.cip-bobp.org/en/tdcc_public, retrieved 2026-10-19.
- Bullet data: makers' published catalogues and product pages (see data/sources.csv); bullet lengths in part
  from the JBM Ballistics bullet length list, https://jbmballistics.com/downloads/lengthlist.html.
- Powder data: datasheets of the makers; burn parameters are BallisticaInterna's own fit to publicly available
  laboratory loads. No makers' load tables are included.
- Every record names its source in data/sources.csv.

